{"4760620":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Astral Boost","steam_appid":4760620,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4827580],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when you'd get home from school, fire up the family computer, and lose hours chasing high scores in your favorite Flash games?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Boost brings that feeling back. Inspired by the golden age of Flash games and classics, this relaxing, score-chasing arcade experience challenges you to build momentum, soar through the atmosphere, and see just how far into space you can go. One more run. One higher score. Just like the good old days. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"Boosting the rocket ship through the clouds. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple: go as far as possible and earn the highest score you can. Mastering the skies takes skill. Each cloud you strike launches you forward, creating opportunities to build speed, momentum, and extend your run. The longer your chain, the faster the game becomes, testing your reflexes as difficulty increases.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"Boosting the rocket ship through the clouds. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How high can you go?<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"The rocket ship has lost all momentum and is floating aimlessly in space. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when you'd get home from school, fire up the family computer, and lose hours chasing high scores in your favorite Flash games?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Boost brings that feeling back. Inspired by the golden age of Flash games and classics, this relaxing, score-chasing arcade experience challenges you to build momentum, soar through the atmosphere, and see just how far into space you can go. One more run. One higher score. Just like the good old days. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"Boosting the rocket ship through the clouds. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/7500558e622385b33510c0f85cc35b58.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple: go as far as possible and earn the highest score you can. Mastering the skies takes skill. Each cloud you strike launches you forward, creating opportunities to build speed, momentum, and extend your run. The longer your chain, the faster the game becomes, testing your reflexes as difficulty increases.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"Boosting the rocket ship through the clouds. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/60e7347381aed8345ea14f99aebe4166.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How high can you go?<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.poster.avif?t=1793645536\" aria-label=\"The rocket ship has lost all momentum and is floating aimlessly in space. \" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.webm?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/extras\/a15fca72ddca0df84ba67e2baf19db97.mp4?t=1793645536\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A little nostalgia. A lot of &quot;just one more run.&quot; Inspired by the golden age of Flash games and classics, Astral Boost brings back the simple joy of chasing high scores and seeing how far you can push your limits. Build momentum, ride the clouds, and launch yourself into space. How far can you go?","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/d0a24816c000cf66f1bbb060b556be13e47dc9c4\/header.jpg?t=1793645536","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/20fb000ac2a7595ef986bbcf03eca003e66fbb86\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793645536","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4760620\/20fb000ac2a7595ef986bbcf03eca003e66fbb86\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793645536","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Blessed Virgin Jerry"],"publishers":["Blessed V